{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "file:main.cpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "main.cpp",
      "filePath": "main.cpp",
      "summary": "binder_demo 可执行文件的入口点，只负责解析命令行参数并分派到 demo:: 命名空间：无参数或 demo/all 走完整演示流程，service/client/servicemanager 则以前台方式单独运行对应的伴生二进制。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "cli", "dispatch", "demo"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "典型的瘦入口设计：main 只做 strcmp 分派，真正的进程编排逻辑全部下沉到 demo/runner。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:demo/runner.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "runner.h",
      "filePath": "demo/runner.h",
      "summary": "声明 demo 演示流程的两个公开入口 runAll() 和 runOne(name)，并在注释中给出 servicemanager → demo_service → demo_client 的三方拓扑关系。",
      "tags": ["header", "type-definition", "api-surface", "demo"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "使用 #pragma once 与 namespace demo 封装，头文件只暴露两个自由函数，实现细节（信号处理、子进程槽位）全部藏在 .cpp 的匿名命名空间中。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:demo/runner.cpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "runner.cpp",
      "filePath": "demo/runner.cpp",
      "summary": "演示流程的核心编排实现：先检查 /dev/binder 是否就绪，再依次拉起 servicemanager 与 demo_service，运行 demo_client 并等待其退出，最后统一清理子进程并输出彩色成功/失败结果。",
      "tags": ["orchestration", "process-management", "signal-handling", "demo", "entry-point"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "把两个长生命周期子进程的 pid 放在文件作用域，是为了让 SIGINT/SIGTERM 处理器能够访问——避免 Ctrl+C 后残留的 servicemanager 一直占着内核 binder 的 context manager 槽位。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:main.cpp:main",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "main",
      "filePath": "main.cpp",
      "lineRange": [23, 33],
      "summary": "读取 argv[1] 作为运行模式，分别调用 demo::runAll() 或 demo::runOne()；模式无法识别时打印用法并返回 2。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "cli", "dispatch"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:demo/runner.cpp:runAll",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "runAll",
      "filePath": "demo/runner.cpp",
      "lineRange": [60, 111],
      "summary": "完整演示流程的驱动函数：校验 binder 驱动与三个二进制是否存在，注册信号处理器，依次启动 servicemanager 和 demo_service，再运行 demo_client 并以其退出码作为整体结果。",
      "tags": ["orchestration", "process-management", "signal-handling", "entry-point"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:demo/runner.cpp:runOne",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "runOne",
      "filePath": "demo/runner.cpp",
      "lineRange": [113, 120],
      "summary": "按名字定位单个伴生二进制并用 execReplace 替换当前进程（成功时不返回），用于以前台方式单独调试 demo_service、demo_client 或 servicemanager。",
      "tags": ["process-management", "exec", "utility"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:demo/runner.cpp:startAndSettle",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "startAndSettle",
      "filePath": "demo/runner.cpp",
      "lineRange": [44, 56],
      "summary": "fork/exec 启动指定二进制后等待 500ms，通过 stillAlive 确认它没有立刻崩溃退出；失败时清空 pid 槽位并返回 -1。",
      "tags": ["process-management", "utility", "validation"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "这种“启动后短暂停顿再探活”的做法，是在没有 readiness 协议时判断子进程是否成功初始化的常见折中手段。"
    }
  ],
